  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERPOLI-24/7 Global Police Communications System Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERPOL&apos;s I-24/7 global police communications system connects law enforcement officers in all INTERPOL member countries. It enables authorized users to share sensitive and urgent police information with their counterparts around the globe, 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. The I-24/7 is the network that enables investigators to access INTERPOL&apos;s range of criminal databases. Authorized users can search and cross-check data in a matter of seconds, with direct access to databases on suspected criminals or wanted persons, stolen and lost travel documents, stolen motor vehicles, fingerprints, DNA profiles, stolen administrative documents and stolen works of art. The I-24/7 network underpins all INTERPOL operational activity and it is the foundation of information exchange between the world&apos;s police.</narrative>
  </description>
